# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL -- NEVER COMMITTED. THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC.
#
# This agent reads a materials-science schema and ingestion kit authored by a
# collaborator. That material was shared with us directly and is unreleased
# work in progress: its own manifest marks it `"tentative": true`,
# `"population_authorized": false`, and "All mapping candidates are disabled
# and require review."
#
# None of it belongs here, and neither does anything derived from it verbatim.
# `data/` therefore holds the kit, the archives it came from, the extracted
# rule predicates (which are the collaborator's SQL, quoted), every working
# bundle and every decision record -- and the whole directory is excluded.
#
# Point the tool at a local copy with MIA_KIT_DIR instead. See README.md.
data/

# Internal planning and status material stays out too -- it describes the
# collaborator's design in detail and is ours to keep, not to publish.
docs/
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets and environments
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.pgpass
.venv/
.venv-kit/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
